flowchart LR
  A[Human Intent] --> B[Project Context]
  E[Enterprise evidence\n(data, not truth)] --> B
  B --> C[Governed Work Package]
  C --> D{Provider Router}
  D --> P[Frontier CLI provider]
  D --> N[Local Compute Node]
  P --> R[ExecutionReceipt]
  N --> R
  R --> V[Verification]
  V --> RR[ResultReceipt]
  RR --> VAL[Validation]
  VAL --> S[ScopeVersion check]
  S --> CAS[CAS]
  CAS --> AU[Immutable Audit]
  AU --> ST[Updated Project State]
